n-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아하세요","audio":"/audio/dff68e1bb91a7d3e7728.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac9e69428d653c8c","term":"겨울","zh":"冬天，冬季","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3","entryId":"64367","definition":"四季中的一个，介于秋天和春天之间的寒冷的季节。","pronunciation":["겨울"]},{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"根据定好的规则和方法活动身体，较量能力或技术。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"b558d7af71515538","term":"중","zh":"的时候","audio":"/audio/b558d7af71515538c58a.mp3","entryId":"79404","definition":"在做某事的期间。","pronunciation":["중"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"什么样的，怎么样的","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问人或事物的特征、内容、性格、性质、模样等。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢，喜爱","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"希望享受着做。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/73ff9c2197cb51051fbf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83172-2-7-2","ko":"예전에는 스키가 좋았는데 요즘에는 스노보드가 더 재미있더라고요.","zh":"以前我喜欢滑雪，不过现在我觉得单板滑雪更有趣。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"예전에는","meaning":"很久以前","explanation":"예전：很久以前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"예전","audio":"/audio/75497dc0562cdf68c50d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70090","senseId":"1","lemma":"예전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예전에는","audio":"/audio/dd88426ee57094c69780.mp3"}},{"text":"스키가","meaning":"滑雪","explanation":"스키：滑雪；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"스키","audio":"/audio/26b4818803729e1e1043.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83172","senseId":"2","lemma":"스키","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"스키가","audio":"/audio/7ee2a18c14741db732eb.mp3"}},{"text":"좋았는데","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋았는데","audio":"/audio/c037cebdc381868d5cef.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘에는","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘에는","audio":"/audio/89b296d651a66ff651ca.mp3"}},{"text":"스노보드가","meaning":"滑雪板，滑雪板运动","explanation":"스노보드：滑雪板，滑雪板运动；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"스노보드","audio":"/audio/d2fc9b54218ac67fbb31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65316","senseId":"1","lemma":"스노보드","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"스노보드가","audio":"/audio/746b3ec848cdad79c940.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"재미있더라고요.","meaning":"有趣，有意思","explanation":"재미있다：有趣，有意思；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"재미있다","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71212","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재미있더라고요","audio":"/audio/5db99123631d9884b1e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"75497dc0562cdf68","term":"예전","zh":"很久以前","audio":"/audio/75497dc0562cdf68c50d.mp3","entryId":"70090","definition":"过去很久的往日。","pronunciation":["예ː전"]},{"id":"26b4818803729e1e","term":"스키","zh":"滑雪","audio":"/audio/26b4818803729e1e1043.mp3","entryId":"83172","definition":"踩着用木头或塑料制成的长条形工具在雪上滑行的运动。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"喜爱，喜欢","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事或某个对象很称心、很满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"d2fc9b54218ac67f","term":"스노보드","zh":"滑雪板，滑雪板运动","audio":"/audio/d2fc9b54218ac67fbb31.mp3","entryId":"65316","definition":"站在一块扁平的木板上滑下被雪覆盖的斜坡的运动；或指该运动中所使用的板。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"e2360d9fd7642ddd","term":"재미있다","zh":"有趣，有意思","audio":"/audio/e2360d9fd7642ddd6242.mp3","entryId":"71212","definition":"有欢欣愉悦的感觉。","pronunciation":["재미읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f904db366664e952ec54.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.042,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83172","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":59,"sequenceScore":2.8687,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["以前我喜欢滑雪，不过现在我觉得单板滑雪更有趣。","在冬季运动中，您喜欢哪种运动呢？","早知道会这样，当初去读研究生才是对的。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["在冬季运动中，您喜欢哪种运动呢？","早知道会这样，当初去读研究生才是对的。","以前我喜欢滑雪，不过现在我觉得单板滑雪更有趣。"],"answer":2}]}
